desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "python"
	title: "源码扫描：Python XPath 拼接"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Python XPath 拼接"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-python-xpath-query"
	risk: "xpath-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-643"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
把外部字符串拼进 XPath 可以改变查询条件，读到未授权节点。

### 风险类型
xpath-injection

### 影响
命中说明代码里出现了该危险 API、配置或数据流入口。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
### 参考
- CWE-643
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 XPath 变量绑定，或对引号和括号做严格转义。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.py": <<<POS
def bad(tree, name):
    return tree.xpath("//user[@name='" + name + "']")

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def ok():
    return 1

NEG
)
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/\.xpath\s*\(|etree\.XPath\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	message: "源码扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	risk: "xpath-injection",
}
